{"id":14569,"slug":"estas-fiestas-patrias-nos-cuidamos-entre-todos","title":"¡Estas Fiestas Patrias nos cuidamos entre todos!","date":"2026-09-16T17:03:43","excerpt":"En la Plaza 21 de Mayo de nuestra comuna, la Oficina de Seguridad Pública, junto a SENDA Previene y Carabineros de la Tercera Comisaría de Maullín, realizaron una campaña informativa para promover la prevención y la seguridad durante estas Fiestas Patrias. Si conduces, hazlo con responsabilidad. No conduzcas si has consumido alcohol o drogas. Respeta […]","categories":[{"id":32,"name":"Seguridad","slug":"seguridad"},{"id":10,"name":"Cultura/Comunidad","slug":"cultura-comunidad"},{"id":34,"name":"Regional","slug":"regional"},{"id":14,"name":"Salud","slug":"salud"}],"author":"Redacción Último Bastión","image":"/images/posts/14569.webp","content":"<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">En la Plaza 21 de Mayo de nuestra comuna, la Oficina de Seguridad Pública, junto a SENDA Previene y Carabineros de la Tercera Comisaría de Maullín, realizaron una campaña informativa para promover la prevención y la seguridad durante estas Fiestas Patrias.</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"🚗\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tec/1/16/1f697.png\"/> Si conduces, hazlo con responsabilidad.</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"🚫\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t6f/1/16/1f6ab.png\"/> No conduzcas si has consumido alcohol o drogas.</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"🛑\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t9b/1/16/1f6d1.png\"/> Respeta las normas y señales del tránsito.</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"✅\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t33/1/16/2705.png\"/> Estas Fiestas Patrias nos cuidamos y regresamos seguros a casa.</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">fuente munimaullin.cl</p>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-14580\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/simulacro-11.jpg\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/simulacro-11.jpg 850w, https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/simulacro-11-300x200.jpg 300w, https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/simulacro-11-768x512.jpg 768w\"/></figure>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-14586\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/simulacro-08-1.jpg\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/simulacro-08-1.jpg 850w, https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/simulacro-08-1-768x512.jpg 768w, https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/simulacro-08-1-300x200.jpg 300w\"/></figure>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-44 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-14573\" data-id=\"14573\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" sr